//
// SmolLM2-1.7B int4 (GGUF q4_0) verify gate: top-k token-level inclusion
// check, NPU (bf16 prefill on q4_0-dequant + int4 gs=32 decode) vs the PLAIN
// HF bf16 model, 2 prompts x 32 greedy tokens, k=5. The delta deliberately
// INCLUDES q4_0 quantization error — the quantization is what is shipped.
//
// Collected by path (`llms/.*/run_npu2_verify`) into the
// check-programming-examples-llms-verify suite (programming_examples/
// CMakeLists.txt), which only the nightly perf workflow runs — not a PR gate.
// Needs the bf16 HF snapshot in the cache and the Q4_0 GGUF: `SMOLLM2_GGUF`
// set on the host (lit.cfg.py forwards it and lights the feature; the Makefile
// exports its `GGUF=`) or the hub file in the HF cache. Run on demand with:
//   lit -v programming_examples/llms/smollm2_1_7b_int4/run_npu2_verify.lit
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, hfweights_huggingfacetb_smollm2_1_7b_instruct
// REQUIRES: smollm2_gguf || hfweights_bartowski_smollm2_1_7b_instruct_gguf
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_peano_verify
// RUN: cd test_peano_verify
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile verify PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: [verify] PASS
